{
  "schema": 1,
  "description": "Snooze eligibility, snoozing, and the reset when a one-off nag is completed. Instants are Unix epoch milliseconds (UTC). now is 2026-10-28T09:00Z (1793178000000) throughout. Swift NagCore is the reference. 'overrides' records known platform differences and asserts them, so a change is noticed. 'skip' marks inputs a platform cannot represent. A task has no repeat rule; completed means a one-off with completedAt set. maxSnoozes null means unlimited.",
  "cases": [
    { "name": "due nag can be snoozed",
      "input": { "op": "snooze", "now": 1793178000000,
